WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.300
Buenas noches.

00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:02.800
I'm La Catrina.

00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:08.400
More than a century ago, José Guadalupe Posada drew me to laugh at the powerful.

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:11.400
Today, the powerful are tech companies.

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:17.100
Every day, an open model on a laptop reads the tech news and writes each of them a calavera…

00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:20.000
…and the code makes sure every rhyme lands.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:21.930
Welcome to Catrina News.
